contact=intro('We’re Here to Listen','Let’s Connect','Have a question about the group or an upcoming session? Send Sherée a message.')+'''<section class="container contact-layout section-space"><div><h2>You don’t have to walk this journey alone.</h2><p>Whether you’re considering your first session or looking for more information, you are welcome to reach out.</p><p>You can use this form without sharing your story in detail. Please share only what you feel comfortable sending.</p><a class="text-link" href="schedule.html">Looking for a session? View the schedule →</a><div class="soft-panel"><h3>Your privacy matters</h3><p>Your message is available to group administrators and sent to the group’s private inbox.</p></div></div><form id="contact-form" class="form-card"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120"></label><label>Email address<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254"></label><label>Subject<input name="subject" required maxlength="160"></label><label>Your message<textarea name="message" rows="6" required minlength="10" maxlength="5000"></textarea></label><div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true"><label>Website<input name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></label></div><p class="form-note">By submitting, you agree to the handling of this information described in our <a href="privacy.html">privacy policy</a>.</p><button class="button" type="submit">Send Message</button><p class="form-status" role="status"></p></form></section>'''
